"<qt>\n"
"The shortcuts entered here can be used as a pseudo-URI scheme in KDE. For "
"example, the shortcut <b>av</b> can be used as in <b>av</b>:<b>my search</"
"b>\n"
"</qt>"
msgstr ""
"<qt>\n"
"Pintasan yang dimasukkan di sini boleh digunakan sebagai skim pseudo-URI "
"dalam KDE. Contohnya, pintasan <b>av</b> boleh digunakan dalam <b>av</b>:"
"<b>carian saya</b>\n"
"</qt>"

